DeployPinsForTest
├── when the chain is mainnet
│   └── it should pin the AmbireAccount implementation and its codehash
├── when the chain is sepolia
│   └── it should pin the AmbireAccount implementation and its codehash
├── when the chain is not supported
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should name the chain in the unsupported chain error
├── when the chain id neighbours sepolia
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should name the chain in the unsupported chain error
└── when the chain id neighbours mainnet
    ├── it should revert
    └── it should name the chain in the unsupported chain error
